{"availability":"available","full":"abhishekkumarnaik34-hub/microduck_rl","name":"microduck_rl","description":"Train 50Hz RL locomotion policies for the Microduck biped robot in MuJoCo with PPO and deploy to real hardware.","category":"Education","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-03T11:50:21Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:59:03Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://abhishekkumarnaik34-hub.github.io","topics":["locomotion","microduck","mujoco","onnx","physics-simulation","reinforcement-learning","robot-learning","robotics","sim-to-real","sim2real"],"demo":"https://abhishekkumarnaik34-hub.github.io/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:42.966Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:42.966Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:42.966Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:42.966Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["microduckrl is a fun and powerful training playground for a virtual robot duck! 🦆","Imagine having a tiny robotic duck that can learn to walk, swim, or do tricks all by itself. That's exactly what microduckrl lets you do. This application creates virtual environments where the duck learns new skills through something called \"reinforcement learning\" - a fancy way of saying the duck practices over and over until it gets better.","The best part? You don't need to be a programmer or a scientist to use it. If you can click a button, you can watch your little duck friend learn amazing new moves!"],"features":["Meet Microduck! This isn't just a cartoon - it's a realistic simulation of a small robotic duck. The physics engine makes it behave just like a real robot would, with all the wobbles and challenges that come with it.","You don't need to understand complex algorithms. Just press \"Start Training\" and watch the magic happen. The application handles all the complicated stuff in the background.","Watch real-time graphs that show how your duck is getting bett